---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="SmartUtilBox | contact">
    <div class="px-4 py-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto space-y-8">
         <section class="py-12 lg:py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"> <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto bg-white rounded-2xl  border-none p-6 sm:p-10"> <div class="mb-10 text-center"> <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4" data-i18n="contact-h1">寫下您的財務挑戰，獲取專業視角</h1> <p class="text-slate-500 leading-relaxed text-lg" data-i18n="contact-desc"> 無論是現金流卡關、對資產配置感到迷惘，還是想了解另類資產的投資邏輯。<br class="hidden sm:block"/>請寫下您目前的狀況，我會親自閱讀並給予回覆。 </p> </div> <form id="contact-form" action="https://formspree.io/f/xvzvlvwa" method="POST" class="space-y-6"> <div> <label for="name" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-800 mb-1" data-i18n="contact-name">姓名 (Name) *</label> <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-400 focus:border-slate-400  outline-none transition-shadow" placeholder="王小明"> </div> <div> <label for="email" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-800 mb-1" data-i18n="contact-email">Email *</label> <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-400 focus:border-slate-400  outline-none transition-shadow" placeholder="example@email.com"> </div> <div> <label for="occupation" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-800 mb-1" data-i18n="contact-occupation">您目前的職業/身份 (可選)</label> <input type="text" id="occupation" name="occupation" class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-400 focus:border-slate-400  outline-none transition-shadow" placeholder="例如：軟體工程師、醫師、企業主"> </div> <div> <label for="message" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-800 mb-1" data-i18n="contact-message">您目前最希望優化的財務目標或遇到的挑戰是什麼？ *</label> <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="5" required class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-400 focus:border-slate-400  outline-none transition-shadow resize-y" placeholder="請盡可能詳細描述您遇到的問題..."></textarea> </div> <div class="pt-4"> <button type="submit" class="w-full bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-white shadow-md font-bold py-4 px-8 rounded-lg shadow-md transition duration-300 transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 text-lg" data-i18n="contact-submit"> 送出需求評估 </button> </div> </form> </div> </section> <!-- Footer inside main content --> <footer class="bg-slate-50 text-white py-6 mt-auto flex-shrink-0"> <div class="container mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-center text-sm max-w-5xl"> <div class="text-center sm:text-left mb-4 sm:mb-0"> <p>&copy; 2026 SmartUtilBox. All rights reserved.</p> <p class="mt-2 text-slate-400" data-i18n="footer-disclaimer">試算結果僅供參考，實際貸款條件以各銀行提供為準。</p> </div> <div class="space-x-4"> <a href="/privacy-policy" class="hover:text-gray-300 underline" data-i18n="footer-privacy">隱私權政策</a>
                        <a href="/about" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-800 underline" data-i18n="footer-about">關於</a> <a href="/disclaimer" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-800 underline" data-i18n="footer-disclaimer">免責聲明</a> <a href="/terms" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-800 underline" class="hover:text-gray-300 underline" data-i18n="footer-terms">服務條款</a> <a href="/blog" class="hover:text-gray-300 underline" data-i18n="footer-guide">理財專欄</a> </div> </div> </footer>
    </div>
</BaseLayout>

<script is:inline>
</script>
